@startuml
participant Caller
participant ProviderComposition as Composition
participant LifecycleController as Lifecycle
participant CommunicationProvider as Provider
Caller -> Composition: operation(public provider-route handle)
Composition -> Lifecycle: authenticate exact generation and state
Lifecycle --> Composition: retained declaration and snapshot
Composition -> Composition: validate authority and operation binding
alt exact and permitted
Composition -> Provider: private virtual operation(internal token)
Provider --> Composition: bounded internal result
Composition --> Caller: public bounded result
else stale, foreign, closed, failed, or mismatched
Composition --> Caller: deterministic rejection without provider dispatch
end
@enduml
